        "notes": "Violence: Players engage in intense combat within both a World War II setting and a nightmarish future. This includes realistic depictions of gunfire, injury, and death, as well as battles with monstrous creatures in surreal, dystopian environments.\r\n\r\nGore: The game contains graphic depictions of blood and gore, such as dismembered bodies and severe, bloody injuries. Notably, the protagonist\u2019s hands undergo a disturbing transformation into demonic, bloodied appendages with purple-red veins, highlighting the horror and gore elements.\r\n\r\nHorror and Supernatural Themes: Players face supernatural horror elements including demonic entities and nightmarish anomalies. The environment features unsettling and disturbing imagery, enhancing the horror experience."
    },
